-13T14:59:10Z\\n\\nassert.NoError?\\n\\n**flc1125** on `instrumentation/github.com/gin-gonic/gin/otelgin/gin.go` (line 117) — 2025-01-13T15:02:32Z\\n\\nI'm wondering, if there's another middleware layer outside this one, would it be removed because of this?\\n\\n**Yiling-J** on `instrumentation/github.com/gin-gonic/gin/otelgin/test/gintrace_test.go` — 2025-01-13T15:27:41Z\\n\\nThe goal of the test is to ensure that temporary files are automatically removed, not to test multipart file parsing. The sole purpose of using `c.FormFile` is to trigger multipart parsing, which creates temporary files. I added a `fileHeader.Open()` test in this function to confirm that the temporary file is available. However, I think checking the value of `ff` is unnecessary.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"flc1125 comment 2025 11 11t13 20 30z flc1125 comment 2025 11 11t13 59 33z akats7 comment 2025 11 11t15 42 57z yile j comment 2025 11 12t01 28 14z akats7 comment 2025 11 12t10 24 52z sourc id src pr 01 pull request fix otelgin remov multipartform temporari file open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 6609 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 6609 author yile j creat 2025 01 13t13 45 43z updat 2025 11 13t01 26 12z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state open branch fix gin _ multipartform main chang 95 0 across 3 file label mileston review comment 28 flc1125 on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin test gintrac _ test go 2025 01 13t14 56 36z i believ the content of ff can be detect here flc1125 on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin test gintrac _ test go 2025 01 13t14 59 10z assert noerror flc1125 on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin gin go line 117 2025 01 13t15 02 32z i m wonder if there s anoth middlewar layer outsid this one would it be remov becaus of this yile j on instrument github com gin gonic gin otelgin test gintrac _ test go 2025 01 13t15 27 41z the goal of the test is to ensur that temporari file are automat remov not to test mul